ransition **from standing to sitting**.\n\nThe question asks **“how does the movement change”**, which implies a **dynamic shift over time**, not a static state.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Correct Answer Should Reflect:\n\n> The host **begins standing behind a podium**, actively gesturing and speaking, then **transitions to sitting in a chair** for the remainder of the segments shown, continuing to interact with guests. There is **no evidence of walking, pacing, or moving around the stage** — his movement is limited to **changing posture from standing to sitting**.\n\n---\n\n### 📌 Final Verdict:\n\n> **‘2’ is incorrect** because it only captures one state (sitting) and ignores the **change** in movement (from standing to sitting) that defines the host’s motion pattern across the video.\n\n✅ A more accurate answer would describe the **transition** — e.g., “Host starts standing, then sits for the remainder of the segments.”"}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 73, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2391.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2392.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2707.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2708.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2709.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2710.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2711.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2712.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2713.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2714.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2715.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2716.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_2717.jpg'], 'response': "The answer **'2'*